lass=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://www.grokhub.io/\"\u003e\n  \u003cheader class=\"source\"\u003e\n      \u003cimg src=\"https://www.grokhub.io/assets/img/grokbot.svg\" class=\"site-icon\" alt=\"\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"\u003e\n\n      \u003ca href=\"https://www.grokhub.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eGrokHub.io\u003c/a\u003e\n  \u003c/header\u003e\n\n  \u003carticle class=\"onebox-body\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/362;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/9/3/937987a4e4b0c2de7bf8e014850673cc522fe59c_2_690x362.png\" class=\"thumbnail\" alt=\"\" data-dominant-color=\"C9CACB\" width=\"690\" height=\"362\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.grokhub.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eGrokHub.io — Grok Bot use cases, plugins, templates, and news\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n  \u003cp\u003eA community directory of practical Grok Bot setups, guides, plugins, templates, and news.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n  \u003c/article\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"onebox-metadata\"\u003e\n    \n    \n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv style=\"clear: both\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThis is one for example (wish i made it \u003cem\u003esigh\u003c/em\u003e). In these hubs you can find grok bots that have been tailored to some workflows, I tried a few but didn’t get much use except for ideas which is what you’re looking for!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eimo grok bots are no different from openclaw or hermes agents. If you never found a usecase for those, then ig you won’t find much in grok bot.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":4,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-26T13:54:36.764Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":1.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":173055,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-usag